# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PERSONAL DATA - never commit, not even to a private repository.
#
# This project is built around photographs of a real, identifiable person.
# Those photographs belong to her, were given for one purpose, and a git
# history is effectively permanent: a file committed once stays in the object
# store even after it is deleted, and a private repo can be made public by one
# wrong click.
#
# If any of these ever need to move between machines, copy them directly.
# Never through here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
input/
sample/
photos/
data/
*.heic
*.HEIC

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS
# .env holds SECRET_KEY (signs her session cookie) and ACCESS_TOKEN (IS her
# login - anyone with it is her), plus the provider API keys, which are
# spendable money.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.crt
secrets/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated and machine-local
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
venv/
.venv/
python/
logs/
*.log
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm

# Regenerated by scripts/make_icons.py and the catalog seeder
app/static/icon-*.png
catalog/covers/*.webp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.bak
*.bak-*
.wf/
